Sunburst/radial hierarchy chart summarizing the MultiMedBench benchmark composition. The center label is “MultiMedBench,” with inner task categories including Medical Image Classification, Report Generation, Medical VQA, Report Summarization, and Medical QA. Outer segments show datasets and sample counts, such as MIMIC-CXR 361242 under image classification, Genomics Pretraining 210698, MIMIC-CXR Report 78775 under report generation, MedMCQA 187005 and MedQA 11451 under medical QA, and MIMIC-III 78875 under report summarization. Smaller labeled datasets include CBIS-DDSM, VINDR-Mammo, PAD-UFES-20, Path-VQA, Slake-VQA, VQA-RAD, and PubMedQA.

Main visible finding: MultiMedBench combines multiple biomedical task types and datasets, with the largest visible contributions coming from medical image classification, medical QA, report generation, and report summarization datasets.
